id: wide-range-telepathy
name: Wide-Range Telepathy
advancement: true
prerequisite: 4+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
tpCost: 4
# "You can select any number of targets with Telepathy" - no ceiling on the tokens targeted; the rest is the table's.
telepathyUnlimited: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Telepathy at any number of Characters, wherever they are.
text: >
  Wide-Range Telepathy: Your telepathic abilities have limitless range.
  –Prerequisites: 4+ Skill Ranks in Clairvoyance
  –TP Cost: 4
  –Effect: You can select any number of targets with Telepathy. Additionally, you can target Characters outside of your
  Battlefield that you cannot see.
